it was absolutely delightful!

00:23:33.850 --> 00:23:37.730
But the real test starts now... with the Autumn Ride!

00:23:37.730 --> 00:23:40.610
Team Fortuna will do their best to complete the course!

00:23:40.610 --> 00:23:44.700
Next time on Long Riders: "The Azumino Autumn Ride! Part 1."
